# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=freetype
pkgver=2.13.3
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Font rendering"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://freetype.org/"
license=(FTL)
depends=(glibc zlib bzip2)
source=("https://download.savannah.gnu.org/releases/freetype/freetype-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('0550350666d427c74daeb85d5ac7bb353acba5f76956395995311a9c6f063289')

build() {
    # no HarfBuzz, PNG (colour emoji) or Brotli yet
    meson setup freetype-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release \
        -D harfbuzz=disabled -D png=disabled -D brotli=disabled -D tests=disabled
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
